### 착유 기록 등록
POST http://localhost:8080/api/milk-records
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cowId": 1,
  "milkDate": "2026-08-06",
  "session": "MORNING",
  "amount": 25.5
}

### 특정 소 착유기록 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/milk-records/cow/1

### 기간별 착유기록 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/milk-records?start=2026-08-01&end=2026-08-06